  "contracts": [
    "default aggregation retains source evidence and existing nested occurrence groups",
    "final image entry represents the group without losing overwritten physical entries",
    "summary preserves any live verdict and strongest severity/confidence",
    "repeated aggregation preserves source verification instead of propagating a summary verdict",
    "up to 2048 retained occurrences; overflow is explicitly incomplete and cannot replace baseline",
    "anonymous observations are not identified solely by equal visible coordinates",
    "opaque keyed report occurrence identity distinguishes physical image entry ordinal",
    "SARIF result properties preserve JSON identity, occurrences, provenance, evidence and available verification",
    "existing SARIF keyed value identity test retained; alert identity and UTF16 columns unchanged"
